    "heirloomTitle": "The Digital Heirloom",
    "intro": "We are Pierrick and Amélie, a couple from Nantes who love cooking and discovering new recipes. We had recipes everywhere: bookmarked tabs, dog-eared notebooks, screenshots, handwritten recipes from our grandmothers, grandfathers, mothers, fathers, friends, colleagues and many others. We needed a cozy place to gather them all.",
